# Reviewed manual baseline for the Laravel 13 / PHP 8.4 application.
# Remaining debt: conditional trait branches with model-specific relations;
# dynamic model classes, Scout paginator/proxy and configured S3 adapter types;
# SQL projection aliases and optional fields on polymorphic resources;
# closed route/entity/status sets validated before match expressions;
# legacy redundant null checks and defensive branches;
# collection nonempty invariants and callback signatures not inferred by PHPStan.
# Each entry is limited to its exact message, path and occurrence count.
